@display("std/ws")
ws: component(path = "std/ws", lang = "heron") {
  | Binds apis and ops to WebSockets, each op a message type on the socket.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/ws/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `@ws` is specified in [Streams](#language.apis.streams.ws_socket).

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
